    atm:fixDescription    "Add the exact phrases 'bounded command-channel handoff' and 'actor-owned request' to all three files (docs/atm-daemon/requirements.md, docs/atm-daemon/architecture.md, docs/atm-daemon/boundaries.md) in contextually appropriate locations on feature/pYe-s23-phase-end-architecture-proof. Merge-forward closes the finding on earlier branches." ;
